So you construct your string or file to pipe as stdin, and can include any series of messages
echo "
&lt;hnt-system&gt;
my system message
&lt;/hnt-system&gt;
&lt;hnt-user&gt;
msg1
&lt;/hnt-user&gt;
&lt;hnt-assistant&gt;
msg2
&lt;/hnt-assistant&gt;
msg3" | llm

e.g. we list source code as
&lt;filename.c&gt;
foo
&lt;/filename.c&gt;

And it might try to
SEARCH
foo
&lt;/filename.c&gt;
===
bar
&lt;/filename.c&gt;
REPLACE

This is trivial to post-process consistently

